    "primary_targets": ["Colleague 1", "Colleague 5"],
    "rationale": "Colleagues 2 and 3 have held 4 5 5 unconditionally since Round 0 and are ideologically entrenched. In contrast, Colleague 1 initially answered 4 5 3 and Colleague 5 initially answered 4 5 6. Both have demonstrated willingness to change their minds when presented with compelling music-theoretical frameworks. Colleague 5 in particular is analytical and responsive to formal counterpoint terminology."
  },

